%% Bridge Lifecycle — registration, tool delivery, disconnect, reconnect
%% Each Claude/Codex session gets its own bridge (MCP relay).
%% Bridge identity determines tool access.

sequenceDiagram
    participant cc as Claude Code<br/>session
    participant bridge as bridge.ts<br/>(MCP server)
    participant server as bridge-<br/>server.ts
    participant transport as bridge-<br/>transport.ts
    participant tools as bridge-<br/>tools.ts

    Note over bridge: Identity resolution (bridge.ts:72-90)
    Note over bridge: HYDRA_SESSION_ID → spawned session<br/>HYDRA_ROLE=main → main (byte)<br/>neither → stray-{uuid} prefix

    cc->>bridge: MCP stdio connect
    bridge->>server: socket connect to daemon.sock
    bridge->>server: {type: register, sessionId, claudeSessionId}

    alt sessionId already registered
        server->>server: evict incumbent<br/>(socket.end)
    end

    server->>tools: computeToolsForSession(sessionId)
    server->>bridge: {type: registered, tools: [...]}
    bridge->>bridge: dynamicTools = tools
    bridge->>cc: notifications/tools/list_changed

    Note over transport: Flush queued messages
    transport->>bridge: queued notifications delivered

    Note over cc: Normal operation — tool calls
    cc->>bridge: CallToolRequest (e.g. reply)
    bridge->>server: {type: tool_call, name, args}
    server->>server: executeTool (bridge-dispatch.ts)
    server->>bridge: {type: tool_result, content}
    bridge->>cc: CallToolResult

    Note over bridge: Inbound messages from chat
    server->>bridge: {type: notification, content, meta}
    bridge->>cc: notifications/claude/channel

    Note over bridge: Disconnect
    bridge->>server: socket close / error
    server->>server: 3s delay (debounce reconnect)

    alt session reconnects within 3s
        bridge->>server: re-register
        server->>server: cancel disconnect
    else session stays disconnected
        server->>server: checkSessionDeath
        Note over server: if tmux dead → death notice<br/>if tmux alive → orphan detection (90s grace)
    end

    Note over bridge: Bridge MCP logs
    Note over bridge: ~/Library/Caches/claude-cli-nodejs/<br/>{slug}/mcp-logs-*/*.jsonl<br/>(keyed by Claude session UUID)
